      "text": "Rockbot | Senior Engineers (Fullstack &amp; Ads) | Remote (US) | rockbot.com<p>Media platform for businesses. Music, TV, digital signage, ads. Runs in restaurants, bars, retail chains across the country.\n~20 engineers, real ownership, backed by Google and UMG.<p>Stack: Go, Vue, GCP, Kubernetes, NATS (future) for device comms.<p>Fullstack: Own features end to end. 5+ yrs backend, 2+ yrs frontend, cloud infra. <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;grnh.se&#x2F;kf32f5fk4us\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;grnh.se&#x2F;kf32f5fk4us</a>\nAds: Ad serving, targeting, measurement, data pipelines. Ad tech background helpful (VAST, IMA SDK, SSAI). Distributed systems, SQL. <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;grnh.se&#x2F;f8msf4aw4us\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;grnh.se&#x2F;f8msf4aw4us</a><p>$150K-$210K + equity + benefits.<p>Questions welcome, or email ryan dot sheppard @ rockbot dot com"
