      "text": "Company: Watchtower Health\nLocation: Remote US\nRole: Founding Full Stack Engineer\nCompensation: Equity only - til funding\nTech: React, Node or Python, SMART on FHIR, healthcare workflows<p>We are building Watchtower Pulse, an AI driven system that lives inside Epic and Cerner to automate DME and discharge workflows. It reads the chart via SMART on FHIR, checks insurance rules, generates complete referral packets, and routes them instantly.<p>Founder has deep hands on hospital and EHR experience. MVP scope is intentionally narrow and pilot conversations are active.<p>Looking for a senior engineer with founder mindset who wants true ownership from day one. Healthcare experience is a plus but not required.<p>Email Kris at watchtowerpulse@gmail.com"
