      "id": 46467458,
      "by": "peter1123581321",
      "text": "RealStack AI | Senior Software Engineer | NYC | Onsite Full-time | Apply here <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;forms.gle&#x2F;X9CzYDBWSGYZnww57\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;forms.gle&#x2F;X9CzYDBWSGYZnww57</a><p>Commercial Real Estate (CRE) is the world’s largest asset class. The annual transaction volume is 10% of US GDP, yet the industry remains slow and archaic because data is locked in PDFs and Excel files. We are transforming CRE into an AI-native asset class by helping investors understand their own assets better.<p>*We are hiring in NYC:*<p>Senior&#x2F;Staff AI&#x2F;IE engineer (NYC)<p>- Architect RAG&#x2F;prompt systems to parse heterogeneous structured data.\n- Develop frameworks connecting LLMs to quantifiable investment decisions.\n- Collaborate with finance experts to translate domain knowledge into code.<p>Senior&#x2F;Staff Full-stack engineer (NYC)<p>- Own the infrastructure and UI that power high-value investment decisions.\n- Design scalable data pipelines and cloud architecture.\n- Tackle complex business logic with domain-driven design.<p>*<i>Who are you:*</i><p>- You build things for fun, obsess over craft, and have a lot of product ideas.\n- You have proven experience shipping production software to solve *ambiguous business problems*.\n- You have experience with end-to-end NLP&#x2F;IE and complex data extraction."
