      "text": "TeeMail&#x2F;OpTee  | Sales | USA Remote | Commission-based| teemail.io\nWe&#x27;re building automation tools for the golf industry. TeeMail handles inbound booking inquiries for golf courses automatically — parses emails, checks availability, sends responses. OpTee is a dashboard for tour operators managing tee time inventory across multiple courses.\nLive customers include premium resorts in Ireland and USA. Looking for someone to own US sales.\nThe role:<p>Commission-based, uncapped\nTarget: golf courses, resorts, tour operators, destination management companies\nShort sales cycles, clear ROI pitch (staff time savings, faster response = more bookings)<p>Good fit if you:<p>Have golf industry connections or hospitality&#x2F;travel tech sales experience\nCan work independently and actually close deals\nWant equity upside in an early-stage company<p>Stack: Python, PostgreSQL, NLP for email parsing, integrations with booking systems\nInterested? Email info@teemail.io with a bit about your background and how you&#x27;d approach the US golf market."
