      "id": 46469223,
      "by": "suydp",
      "text": "Stealth | Software&#x2F;AI Engineer | Remote Anywhere | Full Time<p>Hello, I am bootstrapping an AI companion startup. I believe that within 10 years, more people will date AI than humans. I think this is neither good nor bad, just interesting, and I want to build something in this space.<p>I am looking to hire someone with strong technical and problem solving skills. You will be seeing a lot of problems for the first time and need to just figure out how to hack a solution. Sometimes that involves writing code but not always. It is ok if you don&#x27;t have prior AI experience.<p>Interesting problems we will work on:<p>- extreme latency issues while providing a fully multimodal experience (audio, video, text)<p>- building models that predict when to interrupt in a conversation<p>- building models and control systems for emotion<p>- generating avatar response in real time<p>- custom 3d models from input image<p>- real time or very fast video generation with custom characters<p>- llm memory<p>As I am bootstrapping this, I can only offer up to $4,000&#x2F;mo ($50,000&#x2F;yr) at the moment. If you are interested, please email James at gcyiuqy1 [at] gmail.com"
