      "id": 46469294,
      "by": "digitaltrees",
      "text": "Please don&#x27;t build this. We don&#x27;t need human extinction due to hijacking the evolutionary instinct to bond with other people and knowingly guiding people down an evolutionary dead end.<p>There are so many ideas to explore and problems to solve. I would be happy to give you 5 for free, I have more problems in my business laboratory than I have time to build. I&#x27;ll give you a few ideas to work on. Book office hours if youre interested: hours<a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;calendly.com&#x2F;ryanwmartin&#x2F;open-office-hours\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;calendly.com&#x2F;ryanwmartin&#x2F;open-office-hours</a>"
